WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.500
Let's pray together for day 14.

2
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.940
Father, we are deeply thankful

3
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.820
that you have given to us the holiness without which no one

4
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:20.530
will see the Lord. You have gifted that holiness to us, not

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.560
just legal forgiveness of sins,

6
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.400
but also spiritually pouring into us the

7
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.600
new life, breathing into us again the breath of life

8
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.260
spiritually as you did for Adam physically at the beginning.

9
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.970
We thank you, Lord. In a moment of time, we have been gifted

10
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.760
holiness. We couldn't have earned it.

11
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.700
We couldn't have worked hard enough to deserve it, but you have given

12
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:49.310
us the gift of being one of your saints, one of your holy ones.

13
00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.180
Lord, thank you. Help us to live that out.

14
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.340
You have declared that we are this, and now, Lord, help us

15
00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:01.020
to live out that holiness, not to leave

16
00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.700
holiness and being a saint to some

17
00:01:04.761 --> 00:01:06.940
imaginary group of super Christians.

18
00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:11.120
But Lord, make me a saint. Make me everything

19
00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.960
that you've claimed that I am. Everything that you call me, now produce

20
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:18.940
it in me. Lord, I pray that you would help me

21
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.460
and my friend who is seeking the Lord together with me here.

22
00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:27.040
Lord, would you help us to truly rise up and

23
00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.560
become the people that you say we are?

24
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.680
We know that, Lord, that the holiness that you have given to us needs to be

25
00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.720
followed. It has a will. It has a plan.

26
00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.039
It has a direction. It has a goal for us.

27
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:43.040
And so, Lord, we yield ourselves. We yield ourselves to the goal of

28
00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.700
holiness, to the goal of seeking after you.

29
00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:50.480
Oh, Lord, make over my character. Make over my

30
00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:54.110
heart until not only outwardly but inwardly I am

31
00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:57.160
everything that Jesus died to make me.

32
00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.260
We pray these things in His great and good name.

33
00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:05.490
Let's continue seeking the Lord together for the rest of this time in your

34
00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:05.980
own words.
